<title>UZBEKISTAN: Uzbekistan posts $75 mln trade surplus for Q1.</title>
<headline>Uzbekistan posts $75 mln trade surplus for Q1.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan registered a foreign trade surplus of $74.8 million in January-March of this year, compared to a surplus of $136 million in the same period last year, the macroeconomics and statistics ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>    UZBEK FOREIGN TRADE	    Jan-Mar '97	 Jan-Mar '96</p>
<p>    Exports ($ million)		    985.1		 743.0</p>
<p>    Imports				910.3		 607.0</p>
<p>    Balance				+74.8		+136.0</p>
<p>--Tashkent Newsroom, +7 3712 361958</p>
</text>
